Clear tabs and wide characters cut by ICH, DCH, ECH and insert mode instead
of leaving half of them in the grid.
https://github.com/tmux/tmux/issues/5779
https://github.com/tmux/tmux/commit/b03b71fd4a662e9e24814db16e9beb4ba4721026 (tests: 2f36533e)

